# Shop Extension (panel + overlay)

Canonical package: `extensions/shop-ext/`. Not `shop-panel` / `shop-overlay` (legacy copies).

## Overlay click model

- Cards always from Deadlock Assets API (`api.deadlock-api.com`), not from a match catalog scan.
- Outside `voting_items`, cards are browse-only (no suggest / help ping).
- **`voting_items` click**: `POST /api/ext/shop/vote` with `option: "class:<ClassName>"` plus `category`, `tier`, `name`. Do not use scan indexes (`item:N`) as the primary path.
- Do not show “Loading items…” / “Waiting for streamer shop catalog…” for item vote — bridge starts `voting_items` immediately.
- **Owned cards**: `ownedClasses` from bridge event `shop_owned` (not PNG). Mod reads `#ShopModsSelectedBuild` (equipped) + catalog `owned`/`usedAsComponent` marks — no tab switches. Bridge maps Panorama CSS ids (incl. digit suffixes like `bulletShield1`) to Assets API `class_name` via `panorama-owned-map.ts` — overlay matches exact API names only (no blind camelCase→`upgrade_`). Greys cards, disables click; reject `item already owned`.

## Bridge items vote

- Start mode `items` → stage `voting_items` (no `awaiting_catalog`).
- Tally grows as viewers vote; winner `random_among_voted` (or settings `itemWinnerMode`).
- No votes → fail `no_items`. Apply winner with PNG `cmd` + cfg `bridge_shop_cls` (see `mod-data-transfer.mdc`).

## Panel

- Compact status/timer; item list is overlay-first.
- If panel lists voted items, cast with `class:` + meta when `cls` is present.

## Channels reminder

Game HUD still uses PNG only (`mod-data-transfer.mdc`). Extension surfaces use normal HTTPS to the bridge EBS.
